_of_sky_for_weather_forecast%2C_Dhaka%2C_Bangladesh.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/16/Appearance_of_sky_for_weather_forecast%2C_Dhaka%2C_Bangladesh.JPG/500px-Appearance_of_sky_for_weather_forecast%2C_Dhaka%2C_Bangladesh.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"White cumulus clouds appeared over Dhaka, Bangladesh, when significant flooding was underway in many parts of the country.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAppearance_of_sky_for_weather_forecast%2C_Dhaka%2C_Bangladesh.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Tropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg/500px-Tropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Tropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg/1280px-Tropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Tropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg/500px-Tropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Picture of the sky in the eye of a tropical cyclone","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATropical_cyclone_eyewall_P-3.jpg"}],"sounds":{"sky":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/En-uk-sky.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/38/En-uk-sky.ogg/En-uk-sky.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/En-us-sky.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transc